  "itemCategory": "Ring",
  "rarity": "Legendary",
  "requiresAttunement": true,
  "attunementNote": "Requires Attunement",
  "rulesText": "Ring, Legendary (Requires Attunement)\n\nWhile wearing this ring, you have Advantage on saving throws against spells. If you succeed on the save for a spell of level 7 or lower, the spell has no effect on you. If that spell targeted only you and didn't create an area of effect, you can take a Reaction to deflect the spell back at the spell's caster; the\n\ncaster must make a saving throw against the spell using their own spell save DC."
}
